grund fetch — materialize one configured external fact snapshot.

Usage:  grund fetch <ID>

The selected kind's [[kinds]].fetch executable receives the local ID and returns one declaration, validated before an atomic write.
No check, query, formatter, completion, or LSP operation runs the integration implicitly.

Exit:  0 stored · 1 invalid ID · 2 missing integration, rejected output, or operational error.

Examples:
  grund fetch TICKET-1234         # store that ticket's snapshot in its kind's home

Guide:    https://github.com/agent-grounds/grund/blob/main/docs/user-facing/external-facts.md
Example:  https://github.com/agent-grounds/grund/tree/main/examples/external-tickets
